{
  "about": "Plan KB2: the Kiwix packs shown as book collections through a .gbooks manifest, and how build.py reads each (extractor, filters, groups, title overrides). Gutenberg and nautilus packs carry their own lists and aren't here. `shelves` puts list-carrying book packs (content \"books\") on a Books shelf by name prefix (Plan KB2 Decision 4), and `providers` names who made them, by the same prefixes (a manifest pack's `provider` is its own). `notBooks` lists packs the audit or Neal judged not to be book collections, with why, so upkeep doesn't raise them as candidates. `subjects` (on a manifest pack) and `subjectsByPrefix` (list-carrying book packs, and bookSets by collection id) give Explore's subject ids (tools/subjects/subjects.json v1), 1–3, main first; Gutenberg LCC packs (gutenberg_en_lcc-<class>) get theirs from the class in catalog_gen.",
